Gets the output and status of runs of a Weave tool (a tool created from a Weave workflow). Pass the `recipeId` of the tool and the `runIds` returned by weave_run_tool; omit `runIds` to get the tool's most recent run. Returns each run's status (RUNNING, COMPLETED, FAILED, or CANCELED), progress, any error, and — when complete — a link to every output the run produced. Poll this after running a tool to track progress and read its output. Each output is a JSON entry with a `url`, its `type` (e.g. image, video), and, when known, `width`/`height`/`format`. The response also includes curl instructions for downloading the outputs — the URL+curl path is strongly preferred because it uses far fewer tokens than embedding media inline.

